  unitName: Grudge Flail Sylvia
  unitId: 60575
  unitNumber: 1000
  description: The daughter of a nobleman from the Amdahl Empire. Though she boasted
    of great skill with the demon flail her father had given her, she let herself
    be captured in order to help the twin princesses escape when Amdahl was invaded
    by Palmyna. She then developed a deep grudge against those who sought to steal
    away her country, and broke out of the prison using the strong physique she had
    inherited from her father. Once outside, she targeted Palmyna only to find that
    it had already been destroyed. Losing the reason behind the anger that had burned
    inside of her, she decided to fight against the God Army instead, using her demon
    flail to pulverize the gods.
  summonDesc: The insolent Summoner asking for my help, is you? It would seem I can't
    escape my rotten luck...
  fusionDesc: You use quite the interesting power, but it still relies on people.
    It's nothing to boast of.
